    "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 434.376009,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国秋天最令人惊叹的风光是哪一处吗？有人说是长白山天池两千多米，火山口九月，整座群峰被五花山色染成了绚丽彩锦。有人说是稻城亚丁两千多米，海拔落差深丘，万亩高丘草甸全化作了耀眼纯金错，长白山只能排到第六，稻城亚丁也不是第一，真正排在榜首的那处深藏。在极北边陲一汪高山大湖，一天能变好几种颜色，清晨，峡谷里还能生出像仙境一样在半空盘旋的白雾。今天，咱们就来盘点中国十大最令人惊叹的秋天，绝美风光。老规矩，劳烦您先扣个一点个红心，让我看看这今天都有哪些老朋友在听第十名。内蒙古呼伦贝尔额尔古纳湿地，他占地十二万六千公顷，坐落在根河与额尔古纳河交汇处，被叫做亚洲第一湿地。到了九月，大兴安岭的秋风一吹，整片湿地几乎一夜之间换的颜色，灌木草甸白桦林全染成了纯金。最绝的是额尔古纳河在金黄大地里，拐出无数道弯儿，像一条纯净的翡翠绸缎，在大地上舒展。您站在高处的木栈道上，往前看，视野拉开几十公里，那条河湾划出的圆弧流畅到极致，连掠过的风里都带着草木成熟的清香。大地当画布，江河当笔墨。您说这第一笔秋色够不够？惊艳？第九名，甘肃张掖七彩丹霞西北荒原上的奇迹。它核心面积五十多平方公里，上一年的地壳挤压与风雨雕琢，把彩色泥岩砂岩揉成了连绵起伏的丘陵。别的秋天是看草木变色。张掖的秋天，看的却是大地的筋骨。秋季，大西北的天空瓦蓝通透，毫无杂质。当午后的斜阳打在起伏的山峦上，红橙黄青灰，一层层清晰分明。整片荒原就像被铺上了一层厚厚的巨幅油画，狂风刮了上千万年，不仅没吹干他的生机，反倒吹出了最磅礴的文理，连石头都能在秋天烧的这么绚烂，您说这算不算大自然的鬼斧神工？第八名，四川米亚罗红叶阿坝州李县，很多人去川西看雪山，却不知道秋天的米亚罗才是整个川西最红火的地方。红叶顺着杂谷脑河两岸一路铺开，从海拔两千多米铺到三千多米，每往上走一节，颜色就换一层山脚，还是黄绿半山已经成红。再往上红里掺着雪，十月中下旬最盛，一眼看过去，满山满谷全是红的，被远处的雪山一衬，红的更透。溪水从林子里穿过去，也被印成了红的这不是一两棵树红了，是整条山沟在同一时间烧了起来，您说这么大的气势，谁看了不得愣一会儿。第七名，新疆塔里木胡杨林、塔克拉玛干沙漠边缘。这里是胡阳最集中的地方，全世界九成左右的胡杨林在中国，中国的胡杨又绝大部分长在塔里木。这片土地一年下不了几场雨，一边是流沙，一边是戈壁胡杨，偏偏就在这扎了根，他的根能往地下扎十几米，一路找水叶子，还能把多余的盐分排出去。人们常说，活着一千年不死死了，一千年不倒，倒下，一千年不朽。到了十月中旬，满树的叶子一起变金，金黄的树冠倒映在塔里木河里，水面也成了金的背后就是沙丘这么苍凉的地方。开出这么亮的颜色，您说这是什么样的生命力？第六名，吉林长白山天池、延边安图。它是中国和朝鲜的界湖，更是一座火山的口子。水面海拔两千一百八十九米，湖水最深三百七十三米，差不多是一座一百层的高峰，倒着插进了湖里，周围十六座山峰把它抱在怀里。这是一座活火山，与一千年前有过一次大喷发，炸出了山顶。这么大一个口，雨水和雪水慢慢把它灌满水深，所以蓝得发黑。九月五花山上了，色绿的黄的、红的、红的，一片挨着一片，围着这帮深蓝，可高山上说变就变，一阵雾过来，整个湖就没了。影大半年冰封，只给秋天留这么短短一段，您说这样的兰谁看的不惊叹？从第十到第六名，额尔古纳师弟把河湾画成了一笔金线，张掖丹霞把调色板打翻在了隔壁上。尼亚罗红叶烧红了整条山沟，塔里木胡杨一战就是千年长白山天池，把三百多米的深蓝藏进了火山口，可他们还不是最令人惊叹的。接下来第五道第一名更厉害，有一处地方，几百年一层一层垒出来的山稻子一黄整座山都像在发光。有一处沟谷，三千多个池子，一池一个颜色，边上的林子一片金黄。可排在榜首的那一处，一天里，湖水换几个颜色，连老辈人都说不清他到底有几副面孔，他是哪一处？他凭什么排在天池和鸭丁前面下一集已经同步更新，点开我的头像，进入主页就能看到点个关注，看看谁才是中国秋天最令人惊叹的风光。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00001",
      "start_ms": 270,
      "end_ms": 4290,
      "text": "您知道中国秋天最令人惊叹的风光是哪一处吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4530,
      "end_ms": 8130,
      "text": "有人说是长白山天池两千多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00003",
      "start_ms": 8130,
      "end_ms": 9910,
      "text": "火山口九月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00004",
      "start_ms": 9930,
      "end_ms": 14150,
      "text": "整座群峰被五花山色染成了绚丽彩锦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00005",
      "start_ms": 14570,
      "end_ms": 17990,
      "text": "有人说是稻城亚丁两千多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00006",
      "start_ms": 18210,
      "end_ms": 20210,
      "text": "海拔落差深丘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00007",
      "start_ms": 20290,
      "end_ms": 24890,
      "text": "万亩高丘草甸全化作了耀眼纯金错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00008",
      "start_ms": 25790,
      "end_ms": 27990,
      "text": "长白山只能排到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00009",
      "start_ms": 28510,
      "end_ms": 30840,
      "text": "稻城亚丁也不是第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00010",
      "start_ms": 31580,
      "end_ms": 35200,
      "text": "真正排在榜首的那处深藏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00011",
      "start_ms": 35320,
      "end_ms": 38920,
      "text": "在极北边陲一汪高山大湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00012",
      "start_ms": 39240,
      "end_ms": 41420,
      "text": "一天能变好几种颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00013",
      "start_ms": 42200,
      "end_ms": 42800,
      "text": "清晨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00014",
      "start_ms": 42900,
      "end_ms": 48720,
      "text": "峡谷里还能生出像仙境一样在半空盘旋的白雾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00015",
      "start_ms": 49020,
      "end_ms": 49440,
      "text": "今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00016",
      "start_ms": 49460,
      "end_ms": 53380,
      "text": "咱们就来盘点中国十大最令人惊叹的秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00017",
      "start_ms": 53560,
      "end_ms": 54460,
      "text": "绝美风光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00018",
      "start_ms": 55180,
      "end_ms": 55900,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00019",
      "start_ms": 56180,
      "end_ms": 58780,
      "text": "劳烦您先扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00020",
      "start_ms": 59200,
      "end_ms": 64025,
      "text": "让我看看这今天都有哪些老朋友在听第十名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00021",
      "start_ms": 64420,
      "end_ms": 66935,
      "text": "内蒙古呼伦贝尔额尔古纳湿地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00022",
      "start_ms": 67580,
      "end_ms": 70475,
      "text": "他占地十二万六千公顷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00023",
      "start_ms": 71200,
      "end_ms": 74445,
      "text": "坐落在根河与额尔古纳河交汇处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00024",
      "start_ms": 75100,
      "end_ms": 77575,
      "text": "被叫做亚洲第一湿地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00025",
      "start_ms": 78000,
      "end_ms": 78905,
      "text": "到了九月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00026",
      "start_ms": 79360,
      "end_ms": 81275,
      "text": "大兴安岭的秋风一吹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00027",
      "start_ms": 81850,
      "end_ms": 85235,
      "text": "整片湿地几乎一夜之间换的颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00028",
      "start_ms": 85910,
      "end_ms": 90585,
      "text": "灌木草甸白桦林全染成了纯金。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00029",
      "start_ms": 90970,
      "end_ms": 94730,
      "text": "最绝的是额尔古纳河在金黄大地里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00030",
      "start_ms": 94770,
      "end_ms": 96270,
      "text": "拐出无数道弯儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00031",
      "start_ms": 96690,
      "end_ms": 99090,
      "text": "像一条纯净的翡翠绸缎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00032",
      "start_ms": 99230,
      "end_ms": 100445,
      "text": "在大地上舒展。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00033",
      "start_ms": 100870,
      "end_ms": 103250,
      "text": "您站在高处的木栈道上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00034",
      "start_ms": 103330,
      "end_ms": 104155,
      "text": "往前看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00035",
      "start_ms": 104700,
      "end_ms": 106475,
      "text": "视野拉开几十公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00036",
      "start_ms": 106980,
      "end_ms": 110695,
      "text": "那条河湾划出的圆弧流畅到极致，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00037",
      "start_ms": 111260,
      "end_ms": 114760,
      "text": "连掠过的风里都带着草木成熟的清香。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00038",
      "start_ms": 115160,
      "end_ms": 116415,
      "text": "大地当画布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00039",
      "start_ms": 116730,
      "end_ms": 117955,
      "text": "江河当笔墨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00040",
      "start_ms": 118590,
      "end_ms": 120610,
      "text": "您说这第一笔秋色够不够？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00041",
      "start_ms": 120610,
      "end_ms": 121095,
      "text": "惊艳？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00042",
      "start_ms": 121440,
      "end_ms": 122195,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00043",
      "start_ms": 122550,
      "end_ms": 126535,
      "text": "甘肃张掖七彩丹霞西北荒原上的奇迹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00044",
      "start_ms": 127090,
      "end_ms": 129395,
      "text": "它核心面积五十多平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00045",
      "start_ms": 129910,
      "end_ms": 132905,
      "text": "上一年的地壳挤压与风雨雕琢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00046",
      "start_ms": 133340,
      "end_ms": 137845,
      "text": "把彩色泥岩砂岩揉成了连绵起伏的丘陵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00047",
      "start_ms": 138270,
      "end_ms": 140325,
      "text": "别的秋天是看草木变色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00048",
      "start_ms": 140770,
      "end_ms": 141710,
      "text": "张掖的秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00049",
      "start_ms": 141710,
      "end_ms": 143295,
      "text": "看的却是大地的筋骨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00050",
      "start_ms": 143700,
      "end_ms": 144200,
      "text": "秋季，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00051",
      "start_ms": 144280,
      "end_ms": 146715,
      "text": "大西北的天空瓦蓝通透，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00052",
      "start_ms": 147030,
      "end_ms": 148005,
      "text": "毫无杂质。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00053",
      "start_ms": 148560,
      "end_ms": 151965,
      "text": "当午后的斜阳打在起伏的山峦上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00054",
      "start_ms": 152410,
      "end_ms": 155300,
      "text": "红橙黄青灰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00055",
      "start_ms": 155780,
      "end_ms": 157595,
      "text": "一层层清晰分明。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00056",
      "start_ms": 158100,
      "end_ms": 162835,
      "text": "整片荒原就像被铺上了一层厚厚的巨幅油画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00057",
      "start_ms": 163260,
      "end_ms": 165215,
      "text": "狂风刮了上千万年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00058",
      "start_ms": 165900,
      "end_ms": 168045,
      "text": "不仅没吹干他的生机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00059",
      "start_ms": 168680,
      "end_ms": 171485,
      "text": "反倒吹出了最磅礴的文理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00060",
      "start_ms": 172110,
      "end_ms": 175275,
      "text": "连石头都能在秋天烧的这么绚烂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00061",
      "start_ms": 176170,
      "end_ms": 179245,
      "text": "您说这算不算大自然的鬼斧神工？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00062",
      "start_ms": 179660,
      "end_ms": 180400,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00063",
      "start_ms": 180720,
      "end_ms": 183815,
      "text": "四川米亚罗红叶阿坝州李县，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00064",
      "start_ms": 184660,
      "end_ms": 186995,
      "text": "很多人去川西看雪山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00065",
      "start_ms": 187540,
      "end_ms": 192905,
      "text": "却不知道秋天的米亚罗才是整个川西最红火的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00066",
      "start_ms": 193280,
      "end_ms": 196595,
      "text": "红叶顺着杂谷脑河两岸一路铺开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00067",
      "start_ms": 197160,
      "end_ms": 200085,
      "text": "从海拔两千多米铺到三千多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00068",
      "start_ms": 200650,
      "end_ms": 202175,
      "text": "每往上走一节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00069",
      "start_ms": 202550,
      "end_ms": 205170,
      "text": "颜色就换一层山脚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00070",
      "start_ms": 205270,
      "end_ms": 208065,
      "text": "还是黄绿半山已经成红。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00071",
      "start_ms": 208570,
      "end_ms": 210895,
      "text": "再往上红里掺着雪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00072",
      "start_ms": 211400,
      "end_ms": 213515,
      "text": "十月中下旬最盛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00073",
      "start_ms": 214090,
      "end_ms": 215365,
      "text": "一眼看过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00074",
      "start_ms": 215800,
      "end_ms": 218105,
      "text": "满山满谷全是红的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00075",
      "start_ms": 218660,
      "end_ms": 220775,
      "text": "被远处的雪山一衬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00076",
      "start_ms": 221240,
      "end_ms": 222365,
      "text": "红的更透。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00077",
      "start_ms": 223000,
      "end_ms": 225345,
      "text": "溪水从林子里穿过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00078",
      "start_ms": 225800,
      "end_ms": 230105,
      "text": "也被印成了红的这不是一两棵树红了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00079",
      "start_ms": 230500,
      "end_ms": 233685,
      "text": "是整条山沟在同一时间烧了起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00080",
      "start_ms": 234260,
      "end_ms": 236435,
      "text": "您说这么大的气势，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00081",
      "start_ms": 236840,
      "end_ms": 238565,
      "text": "谁看了不得愣一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00082",
      "start_ms": 238930,
      "end_ms": 239715,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00083",
      "start_ms": 240150,
      "end_ms": 244385,
      "text": "新疆塔里木胡杨林、塔克拉玛干沙漠边缘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00084",
      "start_ms": 245040,
      "end_ms": 247115,
      "text": "这里是胡阳最集中的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00085",
      "start_ms": 247730,
      "end_ms": 251434,
      "text": "全世界九成左右的胡杨林在中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00086",
      "start_ms": 252190,
      "end_ms": 255335,
      "text": "中国的胡杨又绝大部分长在塔里木。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00087",
      "start_ms": 255780,
      "end_ms": 258135,
      "text": "这片土地一年下不了几场雨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00088",
      "start_ms": 258690,
      "end_ms": 259945,
      "text": "一边是流沙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00089",
      "start_ms": 260290,
      "end_ms": 262480,
      "text": "一边是戈壁胡杨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00090",
      "start_ms": 262560,
      "end_ms": 264365,
      "text": "偏偏就在这扎了根，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00091",
      "start_ms": 265050,
      "end_ms": 267055,
      "text": "他的根能往地下扎十几米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00092",
      "start_ms": 267510,
      "end_ms": 269350,
      "text": "一路找水叶子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00093",
      "start_ms": 269350,
      "end_ms": 271455,
      "text": "还能把多余的盐分排出去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00094",
      "start_ms": 271910,
      "end_ms": 272750,
      "text": "人们常说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00095",
      "start_ms": 273250,
      "end_ms": 276040,
      "text": "活着一千年不死死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00096",
      "start_ms": 276040,
      "end_ms": 277145,
      "text": "一千年不倒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00097",
      "start_ms": 277520,
      "end_ms": 278000,
      "text": "倒下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00098",
      "start_ms": 278020,
      "end_ms": 279015,
      "text": "一千年不朽。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00099",
      "start_ms": 279360,
      "end_ms": 280555,
      "text": "到了十月中旬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00100",
      "start_ms": 281120,
      "end_ms": 282875,
      "text": "满树的叶子一起变金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00101",
      "start_ms": 283670,
      "end_ms": 286475,
      "text": "金黄的树冠倒映在塔里木河里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00102",
      "start_ms": 286900,
      "end_ms": 292325,
      "text": "水面也成了金的背后就是沙丘这么苍凉的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00103",
      "start_ms": 293140,
      "end_ms": 294980,
      "text": "开出这么亮的颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00104",
      "start_ms": 295620,
      "end_ms": 297980,
      "text": "您说这是什么样的生命力？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00105",
      "start_ms": 298220,
      "end_ms": 298940,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00106",
      "start_ms": 299420,
      "end_ms": 302880,
      "text": "吉林长白山天池、延边安图。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00107",
      "start_ms": 303560,
      "end_ms": 305880,
      "text": "它是中国和朝鲜的界湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00108",
      "start_ms": 306620,
      "end_ms": 308880,
      "text": "更是一座火山的口子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00109",
      "start_ms": 309360,
      "end_ms": 311740,
      "text": "水面海拔两千一百八十九米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00110",
      "start_ms": 312300,
      "end_ms": 314740,
      "text": "湖水最深三百七十三米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00111",
      "start_ms": 315160,
      "end_ms": 317660,
      "text": "差不多是一座一百层的高峰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00112",
      "start_ms": 317960,
      "end_ms": 319400,
      "text": "倒着插进了湖里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00113",
      "start_ms": 319700,
      "end_ms": 322575,
      "text": "周围十六座山峰把它抱在怀里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00114",
      "start_ms": 322990,
      "end_ms": 324270,
      "text": "这是一座活火山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00115",
      "start_ms": 324930,
      "end_ms": 327450,
      "text": "与一千年前有过一次大喷发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00116",
      "start_ms": 328050,
      "end_ms": 329070,
      "text": "炸出了山顶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00117",
      "start_ms": 329110,
      "end_ms": 330030,
      "text": "这么大一个口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00118",
      "start_ms": 330630,
      "end_ms": 334150,
      "text": "雨水和雪水慢慢把它灌满水深，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00119",
      "start_ms": 334590,
      "end_ms": 336010,
      "text": "所以蓝得发黑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00120",
      "start_ms": 336410,
      "end_ms": 338210,
      "text": "九月五花山上了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00121",
      "start_ms": 338210,
      "end_ms": 341990,
      "text": "色绿的黄的、红的、红的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00122",
      "start_ms": 342210,
      "end_ms": 343370,
      "text": "一片挨着一片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00123",
      "start_ms": 343650,
      "end_ms": 344750,
      "text": "围着这帮深蓝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00124",
      "start_ms": 345250,
      "end_ms": 347010,
      "text": "可高山上说变就变，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00125",
      "start_ms": 347370,
      "end_ms": 348450,
      "text": "一阵雾过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00126",
      "start_ms": 348870,
      "end_ms": 350190,
      "text": "整个湖就没了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00127",
      "start_ms": 350190,
      "end_ms": 351990,
      "text": "影大半年冰封，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00128",
      "start_ms": 352630,
      "end_ms": 355135,
      "text": "只给秋天留这么短短一段，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00129",
      "start_ms": 355820,
      "end_ms": 359555,
      "text": "您说这样的兰谁看的不惊叹？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00130",
      "start_ms": 359940,
      "end_ms": 361460,
      "text": "从第十到第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00131",
      "start_ms": 361700,
      "end_ms": 365825,
      "text": "额尔古纳师弟把河湾画成了一笔金线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00132",
      "start_ms": 366550,
      "end_ms": 370085,
      "text": "张掖丹霞把调色板打翻在了隔壁上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00133",
      "start_ms": 370600,
      "end_ms": 373505,
      "text": "尼亚罗红叶烧红了整条山沟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00134",
      "start_ms": 374230,
      "end_ms": 378820,
      "text": "塔里木胡杨一战就是千年长白山天池，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00135",
      "start_ms": 378820,
      "end_ms": 381815,
      "text": "把三百多米的深蓝藏进了火山口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00136",
      "start_ms": 382410,
      "end_ms": 385005,
      "text": "可他们还不是最令人惊叹的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00137",
      "start_ms": 385430,
      "end_ms": 387675,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一名更厉害，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00138",
      "start_ms": 388050,
      "end_ms": 389005,
      "text": "有一处地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00139",
      "start_ms": 389680,
      "end_ms": 397005,
      "text": "几百年一层一层垒出来的山稻子一黄整座山都像在发光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00140",
      "start_ms": 397450,
      "end_ms": 398655,
      "text": "有一处沟谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00141",
      "start_ms": 399100,
      "end_ms": 400665,
      "text": "三千多个池子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00142",
      "start_ms": 401120,
      "end_ms": 402385,
      "text": "一池一个颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00143",
      "start_ms": 402820,
      "end_ms": 405155,
      "text": "边上的林子一片金黄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00144",
      "start_ms": 405530,
      "end_ms": 407435,
      "text": "可排在榜首的那一处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00145",
      "start_ms": 408110,
      "end_ms": 408770,
      "text": "一天里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00146",
      "start_ms": 408770,
      "end_ms": 410335,
      "text": "湖水换几个颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00147",
      "start_ms": 411030,
      "end_ms": 414255,
      "text": "连老辈人都说不清他到底有几副面孔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00148",
      "start_ms": 414820,
      "end_ms": 415825,
      "text": "他是哪一处？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00149",
      "start_ms": 416410,
      "end_ms": 422325,
      "text": "他凭什么排在天池和鸭丁前面下一集已经同步更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00150",
      "start_ms": 423090,
      "end_ms": 424485,
      "text": "点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00151",
      "start_ms": 425100,
      "end_ms": 428675,
      "text": "进入主页就能看到点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_158f32a208d4e3c0_s00152",
      "start_ms": 429150,
      "end_ms": 433305,
      "text": "看看谁才是中国秋天最令人惊叹的风光。"
    }
  ],
  "previous_context": [],
  "following_context": [],
